    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101815" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχεδίην</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		Adv. formed from the fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχέδιος</span>, of Place, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>at close quarters</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύψον δὲ σχεδίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.830
				</span></i>
			: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοσχεδόν</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of Time,
			<i>soon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				88
			</span></i>; <i>straightway, at once</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				57.4
			</span></i> (s. v.l.).</div>
